                                                "sense_id": "df7f61d8-2fde-39d1-baa9-602e5e0a9a1f",
                                                "text": "The first microprocessor was a 4-bit device called the 4004. Today you can buy 1-bit machines, 4-biters, 8-biters, 12-biters and 16-biters. Which one should you buy, and why?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e2ae75e-63ba-486c-b299-121cc8cd2126",
                                                "sense_id": "df7f61d8-2fde-39d1-baa9-602e5e0a9a1f",
                                                "text": "Didn't know it was an 8-biter first, cool. The ST Star Raiders is pretty cool - my fav one yet & worth any $5."
